&lt;h3&gt;


4. Why this stack works well
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;code&gt;react-hook-form&lt;/code&gt; → minimal re-renders, great performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;code&gt;zod&lt;/code&gt; → schema = validation + types in one place&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;code&gt;shadcn&lt;/code&gt; → accessible, composable UI components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You are all set to use form validation for anything really&lt;/p&gt;

